window.products.push({"id":301016,"name":"BeeGreen 6 Packs Black Jellyfish Reusable Grocery Bags Reusable Shopping Bags For Groceries Foldable Washable Nylon X-Large Grocery Tote Bags For Wome","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81zWNZZ6O9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🥦 【X-LARGE CAPACITY & STURDY】-- Each shopping bag measures L 15’’ x W 6’’ x H 16’’, large enough for groceries, clothes, vegetables, fruits, and bulky items. The handle is 8.7’’ long, perfect for carrying on the shoulder or holding in the hand. These kitchen reusable grocery bags are made of 100% RIP-STOP nylon cloth, reinforced with bias tape and there are no seams at the bottom of the bag, so they are more durable. 🥦 【UNIQUE PATTERNS & DIY】-- The grocery bags contain 6 packs with cute animals, geometry, or solid color. And the unique patterns add more fun to your life and are perfect for wrapping gifts for your family and friends at Christmas or other festivals, the patterns on our reusable gift bag can retain enough mystery. You can also buy the pocket shopping bags for groceries without patterns and DIY them yourself, making them more personal. 🥦 【FOLDABLE & PORTABLE】-- These reusable folding shopping bags are made of lightweight fabric, can be folded into the attached small pouch which is measured 5.3'' * 5.3'', and stored in the car, handbag, backpack, luggage, and your pocket without taking up too much space. It's very convenient to take our shopping reusable bags with you anytime you need them, and reduce the use of disposable shopping bags. 🥦 【MULTI-OCCASIONS & MULTI-PURPOSE】-- Our foldable grocery tote bag is perfect for shopping, groceries, travel, camping, storage, birthday party, and Christmas, and these bags are practical for daily use or as favor gifts for women and men! For example, as holiday gifts for Christmas Thanksgiving Mother's Day, companies can use the nylon grocery bags as employee gifts, or give them to consumers during activities. 🥦 【REUSABLE & MACHINE WASHABLE】-- The collapsible shopping bag is reusable and is a great alternative to single-use plastic bags. What's more, our reusable shopping bags are Machine Washable! When you're toting things like yogurt, eggs, and meat, which can lead to a sticky mess inside of your large grocery tote bag. Now you don't have to worry, our reusable tote bags are easy to cold wash, you can toss these tote grocery bags heavy-duty right into the machine washer to save time!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81zWNZZ6O9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BeeGreen","source_asin":"B0BY47Q64T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-301016","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BY47Q64T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BY47Q64T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
