window.products.push({"id":301027,"name":"Maui 5-Piece Egyptian Cotton Percale Printed Duvet Cover Set Queen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":70.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1OujPzaeHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"If you have been searching for a hotel feel for your own bedroom then there is no better place to start than with 100% cotton duvet covers. And if you are looking to lift and freshen your room then Tribeca Living's beautiful floral range is for you. A 100% cotton duvet cover adorned in striking, pretty and bold florals. Your beautiful new set will include five pieces, helping you recreate hotel luxe at home. Your set will include a gorgeous floral printed cotton duvet cover with two shams and two matching decorative pillows. The oversized duvet cover will add another layer of luxury and it will help to cover extra-deep pillow-top mattresses. Handy ties in the corners on the inside of the duvet will help keep your comforter from shifting. Your new duvet set can also be placed into the washing machine but make sure you tumble dry low. Now all to do is choose which print is for you!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1OujPzaeHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tribeca Living","source_asin":"B0B37HXTDQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-301027","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B37HXTDQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B37HXTDQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":301028,"name":"60 Stems | 20 Pcs Cream White Pampas & 20 Pcs Brown Pampas & 20 Pcs Reed Grass | 17\"/45CM Natural Dried Pampas Grass | Gift Box | Fluffy Plumes Dried ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mAOEIG2TL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Introducing our pampas grass for floor vases, you deserve the best! That is why we have created this highquality pampas grass. Bring style to your home with this beautiful natural pampas grass. Do you want to impress your guests and family? The natural dried pampas grass sheds over time and creates a mess every time you move it around the room. FEATURES Natural Pampas Grass Bundle (60 Stems.) Soft, Dried, Genuine Stalks Preserved for Lasting Beauty Beautiful, Decorative Home Decor Thoughtful Housewarming Gift Idea Classic Color: (20 Cream White Pampas + 20 Original Color Stems + 20 Reed Pampas Grass) Easy to use and clean WHAT IS INCLUDED? Each bundle comes with 20 pieces of Cream White pampas grass and 20 pieces of our adorable Original Color Pampas Grass and 20 pieces Reed Pampas Grass. These branches for decoration are perfect vase fillers for home decor, boho living room decor, natural home decor, earthy decor, sticks for vase decor, pompous floral, dried plants, boho wedding decorations, dried flower arrangements pampas grass decor tall fluffy. HOW TO MAKE YOUR PAMPAS FLUFFY AND PERFECT? Pampas can become squashed in transit however this is normal. To obtain the best look at the pampas please follow the following instructions: 1. Shake off pampas, preferably outside or on the balcony. Please put it in the vase, but do not add water. Put it in the warm sunshine for a few hours, and the flowers will become fluffier. You can use a hairdryer also 2. If you don't want the plumage of the bouquet to fall, you can spray it with transparent spray or hair gel to make it fluffy and fashionable. 3. Place it in a beautiful glass jar or vase for creating a mystic and moody escape. SATISFACTION : please contact us via","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mAOEIG2TL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CHICOPICO","source_asin":"B09GHFXFC9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-301028","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09GHFXFC9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09GHFXFC9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
