window.products.push({"id":301045,"name":"+ 360 S8 Plus Robot Vacuum Cleaner and Mop Combo with Self-Emptying Dock, Botslab LIDAR Navigation Smart Mapping Robot, 2700Pa Suction, Work with Alex","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":399.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61A5PClbZ2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Intelligent Self-emptying Station】This smart robot vacuum can clean the house automatically and return to the base after work, then the base will clean the dustbin and collect everything to the 4L big dust bag, all you have to do is changing the dust bag 5 times a year, really hands-free robot. 【Superior Suction Power】Provided by the brushless motor, this powerful robot can easily draw out pet hair and dirt with a superior 2700Pa suction power, and auto-boost suction to powerful mode on detected carpets and rugs, easily pick up even invisible dust hidden deep inside. 【Precise LiDAR Navigation】3D mapping technology enabled this smart robot accurately mapping the whole house and plan an optimal route in real-time. Anti-collision sensors intelligently detect and avoid obstacles for a thorough and careful cleaning, even in complex scenarios. 【Vacuum & Mop 2-In-1 and Long Running Time】S8 Plus saves time and effort by offering effective one-step vacuuming and mopping cleaning, automatically controls water output with additional pressure, achieves deep stain removal and instant dry-up. Comes with a 5000 mAh high-capacity battery, running up to 3 hours, enough for a long time whole room cleaning. 【Smart APP and Alexa Voice Control】Botslab App allows you to control the robot anytime, anywhere. You can customize maps, schedule cleaning for different rooms or specified zones, find a real-time display of consumables status, set up no-go zones. 2.4GHz WiFi only. Supporting voice control like Alexa, Google Assistant, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61A5PClbZ2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"+ 360","source_asin":"B0C66DYPBL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-301045","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C66DYPBL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C66DYPBL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
