window.products.push({"id":301084,"name":"Poster Foundry The Empress Tarot Card by Brigid Ashwood Luminous Tarot Deck Major Arcana Witchy Decor New Age Diversity Stretched Canvas Art Wall Deco","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71X0AVYRrgL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"Custom designed prints on canvas made from a premium grade cotton poly blend for a modern canvas texture measures 16x24 inches (41x61 cm). Stretched canvas art ships ready to hang. Gallery wrap finish with printing on front and sides of the canvases. Proudly assembled and hand stretched in the USA. High quality finger joined wood stretcher bars are 1.5 inch deep. HAND ASSEMBLED CANVAS WALL ART - Our canvas art wall decor is the perfect piece of art to tie your area together, with each one having a unique personality to make your space seem like home. Ideal for home office decor, kitchen decor, bathroom wall decor, living room wall art, bedroom art decor, and childrens room decor. Our manufacturing expertise have created canvases that are ready to hang right out of the box and do not require any further frame. PRINTED IN THE USA and OFFICIALLY LICENSED. This canvas art is professionally printed in the USA on premium canvas fabric paper for a high color aesthetic and years of fade resistant enjoyment of your artwork. Decorate your space with these unique high-quality canvas prints. EASY TO HANG CAVASES - Our canvas pictures are ready to hang with attached metal hanging wire. All you need is a nail or a hanging hook, and a hammer. Canvas art is a great wall decor option for your home, office, work, living room, kitchen, dining room and bedroom. Collect multiple graphic art photos to create a gallery wall of decorative pieces or sets. We have a variety of aesthetic designs we can offer from vintage and classic to modern and minimalist. ASTROLOGY GIFTS AND SPIRITUAL POSTERS - Astrology room decor with luminous tarot deck tarot card art prints or zodiac wall art posters spiritual make new age wall art. A mystical poster or sun salutations poster of sun moon signs calendar is a cool gift for for Dad Mom Coworker Sister Mom Dad Girlfriend Boyfriend or best friend for anniversary birthday or housewarming. A quality product. quality product.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71X0AVYRrgL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Poster Foundry","source_asin":"B0C59QKGR7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-301084","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C59QKGR7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C59QKGR7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":301085,"name":"HalSign 2020 Christmas Ornaments - Christmas Ornament Personalized 2020 Christmas Ornament Quarantine,Best Memento Gift for Friends - 4 Pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hTAuYneNL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Looking for a fun way to decorate a friend or family member’s tree? If you are tired of the same old boring Christmas ornaments and want to give something that will get a real laugh for this year’s holiday party, then you came to the right listing. The pandemic has turned 2020 into a year to remember. We wore face masks, we got to know our families a lot better, toilet paper was difficult to find in stores. People stockpiled it and fought in stores over it ! Gifting this toilet paper ornament is the way to brighten up someone’s branches! The perfect reminder of what 2020 was about. 2020 will be a year to remember for decades! Celebrate the year no one could have predicted with this Christmas ornament. It perfectly captures the crazy year we've had as toilet paper had never made headlines like it did during this pandemic. Sometimes the best gifts are gifts that make everyone laugh. Don't let these amazing ornament pass you and get yourself this decoration that will be an added laugh at Christmas on the tree and for years to come! Product details : - Dimension : 3.2 inch in diameter - Material : The actual product received shall prevail!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hTAuYneNL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HalSign","source_asin":"B08NYBYVGP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-301085","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08NYBYVGP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08NYBYVGP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":301086,"name":"Tea Bag Holder, Wacky Woollies","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/519LK-9+-WL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"They say that in an Irish home the kettle is always on. A cup of tea is offered upon the arrival of any guest and insisted upon before any departure. Therefore Irish homes must have all the right accessories. This tea bag holder comes in an adorable teapot shape. It is ideal for holding teabags as they cool down and dry before being disposed of while keeping your countertops empty of clutters and dreaded tea stains. This holder is part of the Wacky Woolies Collection of Irish gifts. They are made up of various colourful characters such as sleepy, tipsy, trippy, queasy and lucky. Pick up this tea bag holder and decide which one you and your family members are.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/519LK-9+-WL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wacky Woollies","source_asin":"B01DBWVXJK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-301086","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01DBWVXJK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01DBWVXJK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
