window.products.push({"id":301098,"name":"Space Heater Fan with Timer and Remote,Electric Personal Heater with Adjustable High Low Heat and Safety Features,CITUS Indoor Ceramic Heater with Hea","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IWy7QpX9S._AC_SL1492_.jpg","description":"The multi-functional HEATER + DRYER +FAN is working as warmer in cold days & dryer in all seasons,it supplies you cozy and comfortable time when in bathroom home office .Just place the space heater under your desk to help keep your feet warm. Or set it on the table while reading or watching TV. The heater efficiently warms up your surroundings Features: Heating / Summer Fan / Drying shoes socks clothes etc Working as Personal Space Heater Fan for Home,office etc Distance of remote control:Approx.3 -5meters Package includes: 1× Heater 1× Heat Hose Attachment 1× Water Shield Cover 1× Remote Control 1× Instruction 1- 480mins timer setting,auto-off in 12hours if not timing -Dimensions: 9.5*8.6*5.7 inches - 3.3 lbs Weight - Ceramic PTC Heating - 1000 watts - 110V Voltage - 3 Settings:- High Heat/ Low Heat /Fan only - Fan-forced for Wide Heat Dispersion - 5.25ft Power Cord - Power Indicator Light - Carrying Handle - Safety Tip-Over Switch - Overheat Protection System - Fully Assembled in Box - UL, FCC, CE Certified -Operation 1.Plug the power,the screen will show “888”“OFF” 2.Press the button “OFF/ON” on the heater or the remote control,you can choose for “COL”(fan only) “HO1”(low heat) “HO2”(high heat) and the setting for 1-8 hours timer 3-a.Tips: Long press the \"setting\" button on the heater,you can choose the time (1-480mins) you want to timing freely 3-b.After setting the timer,counting down for minute will display on the screen for seconds,then the screen will show \"COL\",\"HO1\"or\"HO2\" you previously chose. If you want to know the exact minutes left,just press \"setting\"again 4.Please press “OFF/ON” until the screen shows “OFF”,the heater will blow cold wind for one minute then shut down","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IWy7QpX9S._AC_SL1492_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Citus","source_asin":"B07JBP4J1N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-301098","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07JBP4J1N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07JBP4J1N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
