window.products.push({"id":301221,"name":"Topcee Oversized Blanket Hoodie Sweatshirt with Zip, Cozy Warm Hooded Sherpa Fleece Wearable Blanket, Louging Blanket with Giant Pocket, Gifts for Adu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713K0h+0uEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% Polyester Imported 【UNIQUE AND INNOVATIVE DESIGN】Topcee has updated the design of the cozy blanket hoodie, introducing a zipper and large pockets. We can wear this wearable blanket more conveniently, and using the zipper can simplify the tedious process of putting on and taking off oversized hoodies. The large pockets of blanket hoodie on the sides not only provide warmth for our hands, but also hold other things such as remote mobile phones, snacks, and keys, so we can always take what we want wherever we go. 【SOFT AND COMFORTABLE】We've used soft and warm 180 GSM flannel and 200 GSM Sherpa fabrics to create this giant hoodie that will withstand the cold of winter. The high-quality fabric of this wearable garment gives us a unique soft touch and warm comfort, and the double-layer fabric provides extra warmth.We have stronger stitching in the armpits, cuffs, pockets, and hat joints, making zipper blanket hoodie more resistant to breakage! 【ONE SIZE FITS ALL】Our wearing blankets are designed in extra-large sizes, which take into account different body types and are suitable for a variety of people. This wearable blanket comes in four colors, and whether you're a teenager, a man or a woman, there's one for you. So Topcee wearable hoodie is also a reference for holiday gifts, perfect for gifting to your best family and friends on Christmas, Thanksgiving, Mother's Day, Valentine's Day. 【REGENERATED POLYESTER FIBRE】Topcee attaches great importance to environmental protection and product quality. This zipper thick blanket hoodie uses GRS compliant recycled fiber as the production fabric, which is more environmentally friendly and safe. This wearable hoodie is also OEKO-TEX certified, which means it does not contain any harmful substances or chemicals, making it safer, greener and healthier. Eco-friendly product fabrics and high-quality products are Topcee's firm choices. 【EASY CARE】Machine washable. Do not iron. Contrary to the plethora of comfort and convenience that this wearable hoodie can provide, the handling required when caring for the wearable blanket is simple. For care, machine wash in cold water and tumble dry on low heat to keep your blanket hoodie looking like new. It is recommended to wash before the first use for the best experience.Feel free to contact us if you have any questions!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713K0h+0uEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Topcee","source_asin":"B0B4W4C9SL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-301221","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B4W4C9SL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B4W4C9SL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
