window.products.push({"id":301273,"name":"ASD Living 4C-405 Absorbent Cotton (Set of 3) Set of Dishcloths, Marine Green, 10 x 10","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ryCd9k6cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"You must see and touch these beautiful absorbent 100% cotton dish cloths. The newest must have for any bartender, home chef or homeowner! Great for cleaning counters, dishes or perfect for the bath and shower. These are notably popular in Europe and now we are offering sets of three in the USA. These dishcloths are durable and highly absorbent with a subtle texture for greater cleaning potential. Available in color tones; Golden yellow, Leaf Green, Marine Blue, Sky Blue, Neutral, Melon and Rose.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ryCd9k6cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ASD Living","source_asin":"B06Y32WP5J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-301273","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06Y32WP5J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06Y32WP5J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":301274,"name":"Premium PALO SANTO (HOLY WOOD) Authentic 10 Pure Incense Sticks, Wild Harvested, 100% Natural, Use for Dispel Misfortune, Purifying, Cleansing, Healin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81EmuI8Sn3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Palo Santo Benefits: Palo Santo is recognized for a myriad of powerful therapeutic properties, including the ability to uplift mood, strengthen vitality and aid in protection. It is beneficial for meditation, concentration and enhancing creativity and learning. Additionally, Palo Santo serves as a strong medicine popularized for its presence in keeping energies grounded and clear. How to Burn Palo Santo : Burning Instructions: Hold Palo Santo over an open flame, tilting the end down at a 45 degree angle. Once lit, let the wood burn visibly for one minute, relighting as necessary. Blow out the Palo Santo stick and allow to smolder. Because of Palo Santo's particular resinous quality, the embers may self-extinguish after a few minutes. This means the wooden incense can be relit and enjoyed many times. Depending on the wood color different burning method is recommended. Darker wood has more resin on it, it may be more easy to light up and burst into flame. Lighter wood has less resin on it, it may be more hard to burn and may need to be relit many times. The best method is to burn over charcoal. Keep out of reach of children.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81EmuI8Sn3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WELLTED","source_asin":"B07KDHTX9B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-301274","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KDHTX9B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KDHTX9B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
