window.products.push({"id":301276,"name":"Cuisinart Silicone Oven Mitts, 2 Pack - Heat Resistant to 500 Degrees - Handle Hot Kitchen Items Safely - Non-Slip Silicone Grip Oven Gloves with Insu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51HNClR1KeL._AC_.jpg","description":"Imagine the aroma in your home from a delicious pie baking in the oven. The oven timer beeps and the pie has turned a glowing, golden brown. It’s ready. Take all the stress of removing the hot pie dish from the scorching oven with these Cuisinart Oven Mitts / Gloves.Insert your hands into the cotton lined deep gloves and grasp the hot dish with the flexible silicone that is heat resistant to 500 degrees Fahrenheit. The premium polyester filling provides pure protection and safe insulation from hot items. This oven mitt set allow you to get a secure hold on the cookware you are carrying, so there’s no risk of dropping your delicious pie. Meanwhile, the deep pockets point your hands away from the hot item so as to reduce the risk of any hot steam or grease contacting your skin. These oven gloves are great for added protection to your forearms.This pack of 2 Oven Mitts are ideal for holding pasta dishes, pots, plates, bowls and so much more. They allow you to grip a variety kitchen items and utensils of different sizes to protect your hands from extreme temperatures. We also find them useful for opening hard-to-open jar lids because of the ripped silicone texture that grips so well. They are designed to suit many décor styles and can be stored neatly in a drawer or hung using the handy sewn-in hanging tab with metal loop. The mitts are easy care – hand wash and lay flat to dry.Cuisinart – savor the good life. Cuisinart luxury performance kitchen textiles offer a new level of quality, durability and style. Our products are built for comfort and long lasting performance. Enjoy!  The colors you see on your screen may not be a totally accurate reproduction of the actual product. We strive to make our colors as accurate as possible, but screen images are intended as a guide only and should not be regarded as absolutely correct.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51HNClR1KeL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cuisinart","source_asin":"B09G54V9KR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-301276","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09G54V9KR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09G54V9KR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
