window.products.push({"id":301322,"name":"Distressed Wooden Hanging Chalkboard Board with Iron Shelf (Distressed Teal)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bOeFraWHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"With the look of an old and weathered antique piece, this hanging memo board adds a touch of rustic charm and vintage distinction to any room in the house. The Distressed Wooden Hanging Chalkboard board with Iron Shelf is constructed from solid wood that has been painted and distressed to look as though you rescued it from a quaint country barn or a little red schoolhouse. This piece features a flat top ledge with a beveled edge, a rectangular memo board in the center, and a sturdy iron shelf with convex slats reminiscent of old iron fencing. The shelf provides storage for small items and is an obvious place to stash chalk and erasers while the chalkboard itself makes it easy to write to-do lists, keep track of items you need to purchase at the market, or remind family members of appointments they have or places they need to go. Hang it in a mud room, an entry way, a kitchen, or anywhere that you can use a memo board that the whole family can enjoy and benefit from. This board comes in a lovely distressed teal color with a black chalkboard surface, natural wood accents that come through the paint in different areas around the frame, and a dark iron shelf. This piece is also available in a pin board version that features dark natural wood, the same iron shelf, and a fabric style pin board that depicts the image of a whale. The whale pin board option makes a great addition to a beach house or any casual room with a playful, nautical theme. On the whale board, instead of writing and erasing memos with chalk, you can use push pins and fasteners to attach hand written lists, party invitations, family photos, or other small mementos. Both color combinations offer something special and something different to complement your unique home decor style or coordinate with your other favorite vintage pieces.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bOeFraWHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Home Office Collection","source_asin":"B00JEG3CNS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-301322","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00JEG3CNS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00JEG3CNS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
