window.products.push({"id":301453,"name":"Guardian Filtration Products- Pool & Spa Filter Replacement for Pleatco PJANCS200, Unicel C-8418, Filbur FC-0823, Jandy Industries CS200 | Premium Poo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":120.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nV0HJoCqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅ Filters May Be Green or Blue ✅ REPLACEMENT FILTER - Get purer, cleaner water in your pool or spa with these replacement cartridge filters compatible for Pleatco PJANCS200, Filbur FC-0823, Unicel C-8418, and Jandy Industries CS200. Filters May Be Green or Blue ✅ DIMENSIONS - This replacement pool filter cartridge has an 4 inch (4\") open hole top, 4 inch (4\") open hole bottom, 8 15/16 inch (8.9375\") diameter and 33 1/8 inch (33.125\") length. The 200 sq. ft. of premium filter material is easier to clean, filters better and lasts longer. ✅ MULTI PACK SAVINGS - Choose from our value savings single, double or 4 pack filter bundle. Having multiple filters on hand can help extend the life of each and protects your pool or spa because you can keep 1 filter active while cleaning the other for zero filtration downtime. ✅ EASY TO CLEAN - Guardian Filtration Products are designed to be long lasting and easy to clean so you can keep your pool and spa crystal clear and safe for you and your family. Our premium filter material keeps your water clearer and is easier to clean. ✅ Guardian Filtration Products has been operating out of Northwest Pennsylvania since 2003. We're committed to creating affordable, high quality pool filtration products and accessories...Click Add-to-Cart or 1-Click Buy to order your pool/spa filter cartridge today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nV0HJoCqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Guardian Filtration Products","source_asin":"B0BSMX697G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-301453","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BSMX697G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BSMX697G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":301454,"name":"KitchenAid Print Kitchen Towel and Oven Mitt Set, Set of 6, Charcoal 6 Count","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qSi2u9zzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Add a pop of color to kitchen chores with the Kitchen Aid Kitchen Towel and Oven Mitt Bundle 6 Piece Set. The colorful set includes four generously sized, 100 percent cotton kitchen towels with vibrant floral, geometric, and diamond motifs and an oven mitt. The oven mitt is well-crafted with durable cotton fabric and measures 7. 5 inches wide by 14 inches long for a spacious fit. The extra-long length of the mitt also offers added protection for hands and arms from the heat when handling hot pots, pans, and dishware, while the textured, silicone print grips ensure a more secure grip. A polyester lining offers added comfort, and a hanging loop on the mitt makes it easy to display or store the mitt when not in use. One kitchen towel features a pretty floral pattern, a second is adorned with printed poppies, two others features a geometric motif, and the fifth towel has a large diamond motif. The five towels feature matching colors and complement one another well for a stylish and coordinated set. The vibrant design of these towels makes them an attractive display as a decorative accent in your kitchen when they're not in use. Use them for drying dishes, wiping countertops and appliances, cleaning spills, and cleaning food off your tabletop. Keep towels away from flames for safety. The Kitchen Aid Kitchen Towel and Oven Mitt Bundle 6 Piece Set is a must-have accessory for every kitchen and also makes a great housewarming gift. Easy care machine washable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qSi2u9zzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KitchenAid","source_asin":"B07W3653N6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-301454","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07W3653N6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07W3653N6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
