window.products.push({"id":301516,"name":"Shubhkart Nitya Brass Crystal Incense Holder/Agarbatti Stand","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71daJvomenL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Decorative: The product is made up of brass and it has shinny crystals studded in it which gives it an exquisite look. It has a gold finish. The holder is a great addition to the home or office decor. Care Tips: 1) Clean your brass ware by hand and avoid dishwasher as the detergent can cause oxidation leading to permanent damage. 2) Use a solution of equal quantities vinegar or lemon juice and salt diluted with some water at such times but don't use it regularly. 3) Avoid scratchy cleaners like steel wool. Durable Material: It is made up of brass that makes it more beautiful and durable. Easy to clean: It is fitted with a separate ash collector that keeps the pooja house, room and office place clean. Dimensions: Length - (9 cm), Width - (9 cm), Height - (30 cm). Weight- 150 gram Wide Application: Use for Religious Pooja and decoration for home temple Also use as a return and house warming home decor gift. Create a peaceful Environment. LONG BURNING - Incense sticks burn effectively for longer duration due to optimal exposure to Air. Perfect Gift: Gift this to your loved ones on Diwali, Weddings, housewarming and as a Yoga Decor gift. Let their contemporary style home décor find a worthy additional decorative feeling. Multiple sticks at a time: It has the capacity to hold 5 sticks at a time. Does not get hot even after long hours of repeated burning SAFE TO USE - the Incense Sticks burns effectively inside, which prevents direct heat contact with unlike the open incense sticks holders.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71daJvomenL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Shubhkart","source_asin":"B0BPMHBF3T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-301516","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BPMHBF3T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BPMHBF3T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":301517,"name":"Natural Dried White Pampas Grass Decor Tall & Short Pampas Grass (21stems) Boho Room Decor - Pampas Grass Large Fluffy 6 Stems (48”)&15 Small Pampas G","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91SWyGUALpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💮 NATURAL PAMPAS GRASS SMALL & LARGE SET: Create a beautiful arrangement with dried pampas grass stems bundle in your home, the small pampas grass and large pampas grass branches adds style to your boho room decor with large pampas grass decor fluffy that looks like feathers for vase decor , Real pampas grass , Way more beautiful than faux pampas grass. 3️ BEAUTIFUL COLORS: Choose between 3 neutral colors – pink, beige, and white pampas grass; the pink pampas grass adds fresh color, the brown pampas grass branches bring neutral color with fun texture to your home, while the white pampas grass stems brighten your space. 🏠DECORATE YOUR HOME: With our fluffy pampas grass large for tall vases, fill your space in your living room, office, dining space, and any other room with beautiful feathery pampas stems; Perfect for dried floral arrangements depending on your boho plants decor needs, pick between two different size packs, one with 4 long pampas grass for floor vase + 15 short pampas grass bundle and the other with 6 pampas stems large + 15 small pampas grass bulk . 🎁BOHO HOME DECOR GIFTS: Give these bulk pampas grass branches to friends and family who love boho plant decorations and are looking for extra feathery texture to enhance the style of any room in your home; these elegant pampas stems make a beautiful anniversary, Valentine’s Day, birthday, or housewarming gift. 🌞HOW TO NATURALLY FLUFF: Cutiemood packages our pink, white, and beige pampas grass with gentle care so that the grass fronds look lovely when immediately taken out of the box; for extra fluffing, place this dried pampas grass in the sun for a few hours and then remove from direct sunlight, there you have your pampas grass large fluffy .","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91SWyGUALpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cutiemood","source_asin":"B08R9CNW57","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-301517","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08R9CNW57","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08R9CNW57","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
