window.products.push({"id":301605,"name":"Wood Church Paschal Candleholder Candle Stand Easter 2\" Brass Socket","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":215.94,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/414T9YKa7bL._AC_.jpg","description":"Description: Now with a Larger Base! How do we save you so much money? We set up our own woodworking shop to construct quality furniture at affordable prices. We design, craft, construct, test and test again. Our customers are happy with the finished product. Each piece is carefully packed to ensure safe delivery. Shipped in a fine, neutral finish, ready to use. Some light assembly required. Features include: 1) Stands a full 43 high; 2) Standard 2 diameter brass-plated socket to hold candle; 3) Versatile design that is not too contemporary, not too traditional; 4) Non-breakable leucite wax catcher on bobeche; 5) Sturdy 12 base support prevents swaying. Candle sold separately. Finished in pecan stain. Some assembly may be required. -- Solid Wood, Pecan Stain -- 43 H with 2 Dia Brass-Plated Socket, 12 Square Base","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/414T9YKa7bL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Christian Brands","source_asin":"B006TJGYT2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-301605","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B006TJGYT2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B006TJGYT2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":301606,"name":"Luxton Home Calming Weighted Blanket for Women, Men and Children Cotton and Glass Beads (White, 60X80-25lbs)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CvyI0vuKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"OFFERS SLEEP THERAPY: Luxton Home's weighted blanket offers great sleep therapy for adults and kids of any age. It creates a gentle sensation of being held to encourage deep, healthy, sleep so you can rest well under these covers of comfort all day or night. VARIOUS WEIGHT & SIZE: To help you sleep better and faster, make sure to choose the weight of the blanket that's 7%-13% of your weight. Choosing the best weighted blanket for your body will help you achieve optimum relaxation. Luxton Home created various weights and sizes for you to choose from. NATURAL, SAFE AND EFFECTIVE: This is a very natural way that promotes better sleep, instead of invasive other alternatives that could bring out side-effects. Make the switch now and feel safe at all times while experiencing effectiveness at all times. WEIGHT EVENLY DISTRIBUTED: We designed a much more improved technology in our sheets by making the squares into the perfect size. This is to distribute the weight evenly throughout the body. The blanket is also layered with microfiber inside to achieve that perfect cozy and still breathable cool texture. HIGH-QUALITY MATERIAL: Our weighted blankets are made of 100% breathable natural cotton for comfort and coolness that's incomparable to any normal blanket. The stuffing is environmentally friendly, non-glue polyester padding and hypo-allergenic, non-toxic, odorless glass beads to add to that gentle sensation.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CvyI0vuKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Luxton Home","source_asin":"B07LHDBZ1X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-301606","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07LHDBZ1X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07LHDBZ1X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
