window.products.push({"id":301726,"name":"V Care Pineapple Corer Set - Heavy Duty Stainless Steel Coring Tool with Non-Slip Handle to Retain Juice and Integrity of Fruit - Complete with Knife,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+nTC+UyvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"V Care Pineapple Corer Set Perfect Solution The hard spiky exterior of a Pineapple might scare some people off from even attempting to slice them. Well, we have good news! With the innovative V Care Pineapple Corer you can now easily and effortlessly remove the juicy fruit parts from its tough skin in a matter of seconds. Using a coring tool is the most effective and efficient way to retain the integrity of the fruit. Brilliant Design The Pineapple corer was designed to simplify tedious time consuming tasks. It is an absolute must have in all home kitchens, restaurants and commercial kitchens. The coring gadget is made from stainless steel that is long lasting. Ergonomic Handle The Ergonomic handle ensures that maximum pressure can be applied as you twist or push the corer through the fruit without slipping. The handle can easily be removed while storing or cleaning - simply press the button to separate the handle from the blade. Phenomenal Value Added We have made sure that you have every possible tool available to make your life easier when preparing your pineapple. - Knife: Use the sharp knife to cut the head off of the pineapple. Be careful while performing this first step. - Fruit Forks: Use the small cocktail forks to \"enjoy the fruits of your labour\". No pun intended! - Pineapple Eye Remover: Use the eye remover to pick the remaining eyes from the fruit. What's Included? - 1 x Pineapple Peeler (26.3 cm x 8.5 cm)- 1 x Knife (19.5 cm x 2.5 cm)- 8 x Fruit Forks (13.2 cm x 1 cm) - 1 x Pineapple Eye Remover (13.5 cm x 2 cm)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+nTC+UyvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"V CARE","source_asin":"B08WL9MYJR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-301726","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08WL9MYJR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08WL9MYJR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":301727,"name":"Wine Corks, #9 x 1.75in - 100-Count","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.4,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zAKTXBb5L._SL1350_.jpg","description":"Natural wine corks are one of the best ways to protect bottled wine for short-term or long-term aging. These Micro Particle Agglomerated corks are made by breaking up natural cork into small fragments and then reforming them into a perfect shape. The result is an all-natural cork that is stronger and more consistent from end to end. This type of cork will safely allow the wine to breathe and mature while protecting the wine from harmful oxidation. These corks will fit almost any commercially made wine bottle. However, to insure a proper fit, the cork should be 2-3mm bigger than the opening of the bottle. A 1.75in (44mm) cork will slow down the aging process, minimize the head space in the bottle, reduce oxidation and is ideally suited for wines that are intended to age for longer periods.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zAKTXBb5L._SL1350_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Neutrocork   Format: Kitchen","source_asin":"B01C63KILE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-301727","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01C63KILE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01C63KILE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
