window.products.push({"id":301903,"name":"GMISUN Olive Oil Sprayer For Cooking, Non-Aerosol Oil Spray Bottle For Air Fryer, 9.5oz/280ml Kitchen Oil Mister Spritzer For Salad, BBQ, Frying, Baki","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tSyHWEtjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【No More Over-Oiling!】Enjoy delicious food that has all the flavor with 75% less oil. GMISUN olive oil sprayer is specially designed to spray in a vertical or horizontal fan spray pattern that allows for more control and precise application. Each pull releases a very reliable 1/4 teaspoon of oil, so you know exactly how much you’re depositing onto your food or cooking surface, saving oil consumption for a healthy life with fewer calories. An ideal oil dispenser for health-conscious families. 【PRO Spray Bottle For Olive Oil】Storing olive oil in a clear cooking oil sprayer will cause your oil to degrade and turn rancid very quickly! GMISUN olive oil spray bottle set features a yellow-colored design that is specially designed to protect precious olive oil inside from strong sunlight or high temperatures, keeping it fresher for a long time. NO need to worry your oil will go bad after a few weeks in the bottle. 【Exclusive Adjustable '3+2' Noozle】The air fryer oil sprayer is equipped with an adjustable spray nozzle which allows 3 spray settings - Horizontal, Vertical and Off, just simply turn the nozzle to switch between modes between different modes for the best coverage effect. 2 Spray Options: You will get a mist spray if squeeze the handle quickly, a straight-line spray if squeeze slowly. So you can easily decide which spray way is best to cook your food with no compromise on taste. 【Zero Oil Drips/ Oil Leakage/ Oil Clog!】Compared with other easy leaking oil sprayers, ours is upgraded with a durable polypropylene spray head and exclusive leak-free slot design, nicely preventing oil drips while spraying. With internal cover cap gasket for 100% leak-free, no need to worry about the oil leaking and getting all over our hands. No clogging issues, safe and durable for long-term use. 【100% SATISFACTION】All products come with a 30-day money-back guarantee, 1-year warranty, and forever support from our customer care. If for any reason you are not satisfied with our products, please contact us freely, we will provide the best solutions for you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tSyHWEtjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GM GMISUN","source_asin":"B0BL144QMN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-301903","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BL144QMN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BL144QMN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
